+### Explicit Deformation Field
+[S3, unofficial] Uses a separate deformation field that can map from the deformed space to a canonical space where the NeRF is embedded. This can be thought of as space warping or scene flow. It shoots straight rays into deformed space and bends them into the canonical scene, usually by regressing per-point offsets for points on the straight ray using a coordinate-based MLP that is conditioned on the deformation.
 
